Package: dmaTheme
Title: DMA Theme - Semantic Color Palettes for Data Visualization
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Dunsworth-Mann", "Analytics LLC", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "contact@dunsworth-mann.com")
Description: A semantic color palette for data visualization in R.
    Provides qualitative, sequential, and diverging color palettes
    focused on blues, teals, turquoises, and greens with warm
    error/warning colors. Compatible with ggplot2, plotly, and
    base R graphics.
